Plain summary (the numbered sections below are what count): This is NOT
an open-source license. You may use, change, and share MoneyQuest for free
for non-commercial purposes. You may make money from a work that uses 5%
or less of MoneyQuest, if you give credit (but not from the Licensor's
images, audio, video, or fonts). You may not make money from
MoneyQuest itself, or from anything that uses more than 5% of it, unless
the Licensor gives you signed written permission. Ideas, facts, game
mechanics as such, public-domain data, and third-party files are not
claimed, and fair use is not limited. This version replaces all earlier
versions for every copy of MoneyQuest obtained from November 2, 2026 on.

If you do not accept these rules, you have no permission to copy, modify,
share, run, or otherwise use the Original Work, except for rights the law
gives you anyway and the rights GitHub's Terms of Service give you to view
and fork the repository on GitHub.

