7. AI and Machine Learning

   (a) A dataset, training set, or retrieval system for an AI or machine
       learning model that contains any part of the Original Work is a
       Covered Work, and every part copied into it counts toward its Used
       Portion. Using it to train, fine-tune, or evaluate a model that you
       or your Affiliates sell or use commercially is Commercial Use of
       it, so if its Used Portion meets the Five Percent Threshold, you
       need Written Permission.
   (b) Any output from an AI tool that copies or is substantially similar
       to the Original Work counts toward the Used Portion of the work it
       is used in, just as if you had copied it yourself.
   (c) This Section applies to anyone who has accepted this license. It
       does not limit rights GitHub has under its Terms of Service, or
       rights the law gives regardless of this license.

